The "Great Wave off Kanagawa" (神奈川沖浪裏) source image used to derive
the hero ASCII art is by Katsushika Hokusai (c. 1831) and is in the
worldwide public domain. The derived ASCII art is released under MIT
along with the rest of this repository.
